      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What is your vr headst and tracker setup?\nYour best bet is to ask in the vrchat discord full body tracking channel as this is most likely an issue with your setup. The only time I know of an offset like that to occur could be your playspace is not setup properly, or if you have a hybrid setup there could be more involved.",
